        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_blessing/text"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:zokher_haberit">For Thou dost remember from eternity all that has been forgotten and there is no forgetfulness before Thy glorious throne and the binding of Isaac wilt Thou remember on behalf of his seed in compassion this day. Blessed art Thou, O Lord, who remembers the covenant.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
